Third-party models downloaded at runtime (not distributed with this source):

  Xenova/larger_clap_general      ONNX export of laion/larger_clap_general
  Xenova/mobileclip_s0            ONNX export of apple/MobileCLIP-S0

These are fetched from Hugging Face on first use of --clap / --clip and are
governed by their own upstream licenses. The precomputed label embeddings in
src/clap_text_feats.bin and src/clip_text_feats.bin are derived from the text
towers of those models.
